  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a2866f162ca5df7c6c4d367",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼诶……刚才的难道是……\r\n恶作剧……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d07a3ba13f2871ee54310094edbba55d27f1406ece4dd7fb314e595416efc11",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "70017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b562c1c62e7cfb5741af785",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要加油了，哦——！",
      "source_fingerprint": "20758fc051f8e40c3383b20bc1cfb64a39f5336afffa38143f6d4b9c9a0de22f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:997b2777e10e0fb8719eca61",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就算是米浴，也能绽放……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "75209791e9cdb4f75f9924d7b80ada956cbcdb10900881f70a072de57063f753",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d771150ae76d113355368744",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "挑衣服开心归开心，可是很困难……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d7a9bc67cc2b796350d4a25b0fb6a1385cd1758c56cb6a1d2c58394ff47ffcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4356e795530e823567fa2416",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "米浴果然还是喜欢\r\n可爱的衣服吧……♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "807fb055147d141db8d11b857d36de429ec6551b0364f17f3549f20b54519d77",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7876246c01710f0926cd0feb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "米浴，成为幸福的\r\n料理人了呢……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cbf9f7db0e317ef52cb740c7a6cfa33a22cc736c55970fb397e6591d26e3837e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "70216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:28ac393bb75004707f3c7218",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "徽章是米浴亲手做的……\r\n是米浴的，自信之作哦……♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "ceebd3be31d99686beb5705952520d7560b406f6ad91351de79d3aa6c536c551",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "70217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:943d81db8ec0d68bceb6fdeb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "制服，合适吗…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0fbfcc1619b3cb23a738bff1068ffaf14855ec8aae28f3043e582c3fd89602af",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "71004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:61944a8bb0cd27cc37d44543",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼哇啊…轻飘飘的～…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a820631a615584e401767facdc772aaeab9b17276ca91b0e6941269651145eb7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "71008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50b547c78533145f8bab330d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就像蔷薇花一样…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4b17b229e6e3a2657610ea01851b3083623b54ecd44756ad8eeef16c01357ac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "71009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97d4b192be4920ace49b6e26",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来到这里真是太好了…\n因为遇见了重要的人们。",
      "source_fingerprint": "97e5d807293718437861029f55d8875fc08d4afb172c4f0d7325e10193bd256d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "71010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c382ce939668ceb59bf99fe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "被这样盯着看的话…好害羞啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "20857c6de226ab55db50a65520f727bf5e4d99ddbc3251e8fc0dae498163962f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "71014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f97f6551e83438b141e317d6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "米浴也一定…很耀眼吧…",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc6d91df76994e33aec5441733f76fcb35ea2531d266be092e9f5446e6fe0784",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "71015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e95b51fa9ba5a7f7c4e9a86b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好、好了，吸血鬼米浴……来了哦。\r\n……呜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd53ec212e1784fbe61064262a5886bceebe2bf245b15d28d7e140ca8c51733b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "71016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e6e1c25547c7dc61a9a129d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼诶……刚才的难道是……恶作剧……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "498912a0fdd7eef5abc6442f61d017b4a9b3f1a6fcc09119c80947556441df37",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "71017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bfcde736f207cc80ffd3a09a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要加油了，哦——！",
      "source_fingerprint": "20758fc051f8e40c3383b20bc1cfb64a39f5336afffa38143f6d4b9c9a0de22f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3cb63ce32051101b44311ab0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就算是米浴，也能绽放……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "75209791e9cdb4f75f9924d7b80ada956cbcdb10900881f70a072de57063f753",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b5f1feb4f1476d32a0ad12ab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "米浴，成为幸福的料理人了呢……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2846726d50bea7dc5be575811aa04965fd277296065372d2c819b06a1f64ec5b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "71216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d4b634779a1e0e6569c5def0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "徽章是米浴亲手做的……\r\n是米浴的，自信之作哦……♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "ceebd3be31d99686beb5705952520d7560b406f6ad91351de79d3aa6c536c551",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "71217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e4fcd6beabe8d6433ca152c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛、辛苦了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d57f6be6bf18e026343d4a3019a3c2877ece9ca74c5ee84af48e1fdd8259feab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:617e26516b0a97dda6a8cf84",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请、请多多指教……",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f3d0f9d88578bc0cc192618ffedfbc819213a304286251cd20ab530f8bc53cc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "81000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:184dbb5d01eaa348ce906de2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "米、米浴，\r\n还能……继续加油……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dfcfeddbbad93a6a838ee8fe900ba94f151380a5e6845f1227958bf0bd182220",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "81001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b90b6cca724898006be1023",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哥…哥哥！\n那个…早，早上好！\n…太好了，终于好好地说出来了…",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e10d2e7b5a798e17d87c9793ae1488c0357f351b1a840d960f198444336eb45",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49b557a56d3bfb5c1649e0d7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上去训练时遇到了\n麦昆同学…跑得非常漂亮，\n优雅…让人心跳加速…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a938286c5e75572d1dfc7b3bb530f151842a0751f76da24273e71ac1c661cbc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:232ebb33a1ea6595ac0f1162",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "刚才，怒涛同学的便当\n被鸟抢走了…看起来很好吃\n什么的…如果米浴不说的话！",
      "source_fingerprint": "009baee63114a56e7797d84bd1cfb4a1c1036d489551054dbd60b22a32183c61",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5de66def4c3776c42588f40b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下午也请多关照！\n诶嘿嘿，很期待和哥哥\n一起的训练呢…",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ce254dafe6577fc134a8fd1926723190349bc4d98e4f8798c89111f39048209",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:def39f852566337d5171a7a0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了，哥哥。\n…让你工作到这么晚，对不起。\n米浴也要更加努力了呢…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f28fc80cfb822bba4d86a0696fda440b23f1e608cec7eb96f0f07f3cf8334b5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:478b36b4f79eb5ec83dccc3a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还不困，还不困…\n米浴还不困哦…呼啊啊…",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb1629b0eb1450619e9c17bced50bb135d01fa74bd5719b622ed96812d083f9f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aae165a0b5768d9c86a8075f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在外面跑的时候，在路边的角落里\n发现了朵小花。\n…已经是春天了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b38b4ebead8c6e7457db5de984d59c144da2da5b7e1b7f10d78605db13a2ab57",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2faa72d870b5bd9b3c533a70",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…好热呢，哥哥…\n哈呼…就像粥一样，\n要融化了…",
      "source_fingerprint": "894f668c0e0615a0df5cb5a3a5800c8abea7514eb050f689c1f7b56e1608a352",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d9f2f1218c5944d91ad0ba5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵，因为有漂亮的落叶\n所以捡回来了。妈妈收到信后\n会高兴吗…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0034adfffe367cefac12815cbeae602e8dcee100c5fa8b045cb54e7c28d1cf3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d8fdb4068a4cf281d8236454",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "诶嘿嘿，哥哥的脸蛋\n像苹果一样。呵呵，\n米浴的脸蛋…怎么样？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b43f9dedaa39f740d19bf1ebfca9a20c80948e2d7195cef170eeec7ce8f7385",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:882ded50e72fc21fbba05ef8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哥哥，有点困了吗…？\n点心，要吃吗？吃了甜食\n也许会精神点…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c726fe66ddedc6f43cdd1281db8eb061c1a2f3a2942e27cd5036a8484b8a21e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02de1b2bb6487973284a45ed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈呜……呵呵。我熬夜了。\r\n因为一直在想着要是\r\n变成蝙蝠先生的话要去哪里……",
      "source_fingerprint": "83dfc8a799f799a17650ec61cc23f104fa42ddf09e564f0c3abc8b2a9d509dc4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c37a9015b692234b9b69b58",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要是真的变成了吸血鬼的话……\r\n想忍着只喝番茄汁呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "90472ee291ab83055e747b8432ecdfefa60c5872e08ab9e6259ec5f7ff155a5e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:daf320f3fe9fcd2450f22901",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "吸血鬼白天是要睡觉的吧……\r\n哥哥，有觉得累了吗？\r\n要一起睡午觉吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e39feb00a15a2e10c1a7318710d8a1b7d4f71f521ad6056a3fe24e9c27a57cb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d90aab742f62a30ec3df41e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "吸血鬼米浴晚上也很有精神哦！\r\n哥哥，有什么我可以\r\n帮忙的吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "463c1ff851325827a1439ec19264afb8b4a131b565b58a7f1cbc192ec3e48dd1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1eef0a06bf71f87c2c351ecb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "晚上……要、要是遇到\r\n鬼先生的话怎么办……\r\n这身打扮……能好好相处吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "37da402a0b9a80610fa5d731a369e31a5cca2ecab626eaee76a15f0c1f4b3fe2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6dff483fe14da763a320e201",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "据说也有吸花蜜的蝙蝠。\r\n呵呵，好可爱……\r\n真想见一见啊……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cea522ca57f69a06cb5618905701d3fcdf4fb9da07d19a72c6a59f82c66c57e3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92b0efbc4bed21f67a7c8f20",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夏天能听到很多\r\n鬼先生的故事呢……啊呜……\r\n万圣节之外也有好多鬼怪……",
      "source_fingerprint": "893edc0469fc66656618b9df8273ad29c165cdb5ff976c9d9055a0a57409a402",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a69b3faf089158714ccc102",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "南瓜派、栗子蛋挞梨蛋糕\r\n还有红薯曲奇！\r\n哥哥喜欢哪个呢……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f282ea7ee7da4d4bc0d611cca00167ad5e15aff814a305afd36ca081cfe483c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3af3a84bdf9769cd022089cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "住在大城堡的吸血鬼，到了冬天\r\n感觉会很冷呢……如果是米浴\r\n的话，大概会离不开暖炉……",
      "source_fingerprint": "33c24e7e3dca15f5f76cf7928820d1f99707b1c3a7342331294fea41d8f684da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee79aa6211488c3bd4cc210b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐",
      "source_fingerprint": "9392c70765a5a96081978bc15cd29abd7d78628fdd8840f21389130a9a70469b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9cad68e1e1441ca841e259d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐",
      "source_fingerprint": "9392c70765a5a96081978bc15cd29abd7d78628fdd8840f21389130a9a70469b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e122f2497662a36f404ea73f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "姐…姐姐！\n那个…早，早上好！\n…太好了，终于好好地说出来了…",
      "source_fingerprint": "7eb114e77e85e31a53292595015b4ce07dd4783ecc504fb31b3db2450664e13e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80dcc779bd90f49f64c2d918",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下午也请多关照！\n诶嘿嘿，很期待和姐姐\n一起的训练呢…",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c3cf8a32b0623d97c14cb76b05665d4a036586a377762083c787e95eaff9415",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90103"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00812af5e895e09b887cedc0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了，姐姐。\n…让你工作到这么晚，对不起。\n米浴也要更加努力了呢…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4cdb00e4992ca46acc8628c730c3850fdce71fa26fc6434aef129bb33a4a999",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90104"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a39ab30c921a6b0cdb84a90c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…好热呢，姐姐…\n哈呼…就像粥一样，\n要融化了…",
      "source_fingerprint": "f2af7a6c0033708ea59abdb1fa18597952bef99e2bec25c387dd9f2f8f567b9f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90107"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b17276079217350362ae02d4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "诶嘿嘿，姐姐的脸蛋\n像苹果一样。呵呵，\n米浴的脸蛋…怎么样？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0fb5c6ff26af0adbc1df370b833e0bba21a1d51bcdb272e24935cf2a4c8148f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90109"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd80bbdfee2feb074bbeaa06",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "姐姐，你困了吗……？\r\n要吃点心吗？吃点甜食的话\r\n说不定就能清醒一些了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7853f8cc6a29665f5831f3021af996a6abb23822caba7f22fdf9ab3352ab74f3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90110"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:806d8ef1801cbd4e2937fb30",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "吸血鬼白天是要睡觉的吧……\r\n姐姐，有觉得累了吗？\r\n要一起睡午觉吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e653f703983321077ea649cc0d83054a6c601f0774d2baab3d828d9e8e90415e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90113"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c8f516dec9c3e83eabd1474",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "吸血鬼米浴晚上也很有精神哦！\r\n姐姐，有什么我可以\r\n帮忙的吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "585fd6a612b47a72bcfbf553b2af96cad1c3aafff86c352f22f79c6e9a2bc4bf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90114"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be6d7902ca59fdcfb4a00a79",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "南瓜派、栗子蛋挞梨蛋糕\n还有红薯曲奇！\n姐姐喜欢哪个呢……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff1444b966419039651e3435e16559e5917a365429bbbaafbc9e269a0a5dc8e4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90118"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5cc3ec14345e97fac1e92a4b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然做了可怕的梦……\r\n但一见到哥哥就没事了。\r\n谢谢你……哥哥。",
      "source_fingerprint": "38d5198dc24ebe3a8ea36c9f9ee422982399738a8d77ce45e3368f37c0aac811",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90210"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b9541ae520fe96cc994f3f3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "咦……？欸嘿嘿，\r\n哥哥头发都睡乱了。\r\n米浴来帮你好好打理一下吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9831ada26214ce3484f7bd2edd66e80a89af2458bd283bab6fc29135f0f517e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1d5583ce189629c58879b5b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为小测验很努力……\r\n和班里的大家吃了奖赏午餐。\r\n要是以后……也还能这样就好了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "541dea3f228a7628ee5e3cd8f8e0086bb1150cc7fc9aea7be8b397084c603c33",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90212"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb6067913da9ee14f6ab4f0e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "米浴，想了个可爱又好吃的便当。\r\n然后呢……今天中午\r\n想请你尝一尝……可以吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "371301e841537c42f1d0897fcbf8900338ee6f1afbe4320b7ab3d75cb9d1d51c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90213"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9274a61d2ec03c513ddddd9e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "晚上睡不着的时候，妈妈会给我唱歌。\r\n『胡萝卜睡觉觉，米浴也睡觉觉』\r\n……很可爱吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "dceb778ddba0adc739b43d8a229182e5939a85d9ea53e73a172fafd7c2e6aef9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90214"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08a2706a945f96a3ea452fae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我做了夜宵哦……\r\n米、米浴的米饭之力……什么的。\r\n要是能让你打起精神来就好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a3f2209ec1a109d4c779d03846f49cc3e1924f5517721b13adf655db71231fc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90215"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0998444857ba9b4f493135e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "发现了一颗可爱的樱花树。\r\n之后米浴打算做便当……\r\n请……请和我一起去响发。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0933a0f2b70690e30a8d8505238b4452c51d60175d5078e829221dec952f387e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79d8975feec0f7010aa0ce70",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哥哥，夏乏了吗……？那个，\r\n不要勉强自己哦！然后然后……\r\n加油——加油——打起精神来吧——",
      "source_fingerprint": "afccbb1c7a04b836a150ec07ef96c75dbb4c02e3b70447caa06dc2d70bacb2de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:790049cd2e2edb784e8911d7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼哇……栗子胡萝卜饭真好吃啊。\r\n米浴，每天都能吃得下哦……♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "5fd114982c517f98fda06ae90dfd704364da1771e61223f026fb999867e6e575",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2893d82db9c8c075498eaa6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下雪天不想从被炉里出来啊……\r\n哥哥也和米浴一样……\r\n是小蜗牛吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "50072894d8bfe24fecf86c10f1318e44543c5c3ff9a0331ac1625547a459c0f0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90219"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5a59ced7bfce32cf15dcb38",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐",
      "source_fingerprint": "9392c70765a5a96081978bc15cd29abd7d78628fdd8840f21389130a9a70469b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0c57929e879514221230de7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然做了可怕的梦……\r\n但一见到姐姐就没事了。\r\n谢谢你……姐姐。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e36105667f681967304d788ff59b656bcb190bf956fe63254919396e75979c6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90310"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ce8e2e4c49183233f1cb5be",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "咦……？欸嘿嘿，\r\n姐姐头发都睡乱了。\r\n米浴来帮你好好打理一下吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "67abfc679b5f814daecfff546dacceb58bacad5dd394118ccc4957d7621f268d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90311"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52f531ea22e0502c3d0cd84b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "姐姐，夏乏了吗……？那个，\r\n不要勉强自己哦！然后然后……\r\n加油——加油——打起精神来吧——",
      "source_fingerprint": "25dddd00b9c7ac6a890f98e9cb0ae28f46b4631c11ffa2c52d24c41242ffd0ee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90317"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a422c35b382fb81b70f0a4f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下雪天不想从被炉里出来啊……\r\n姐姐也和米浴一样……\r\n是小蜗牛吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5f1872ea8d771d155f166413cb9845a31cde84e12f9499e57087233edc5ee89",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "90319"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5d9d285ecef0d9d6feef1e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "总是带着笑容拼命地…\n每次看到小乌拉拉，\n就觉得米浴也要加油了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "156d11ecc5a4b261c9921c6106dcdb0dbd0d1c44d1df9c6d4a145a7980f2e2ad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8256402717d8ea8f3d96c43f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天打扫卫生的时候，希望不会\n把水洒出来…希望大家不会\n踩在光溜溜的地板上…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a16327848e2fae13d79046f5d4b4b064b2943b15f61120b0b586a120c998091",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:856b9a3ba80ceb40a7797b58",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊，啊咧？刚才还在\n那里的，进王同学…\n这就是所说的，爆进的力量…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "91d7c184f1bdd791b94d803c7d32b0e3e9f40018efbc2cc8957fd4006f563ace",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:64a04653b32ed69dd66c75bc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "丸善同学，为什么会\n邀请我去兜风呢…明明之前\n也塞车了…真温柔啊…",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d928a7cd8926612a7916a078e3e2b84a274f2da4370379f7d67acd8fe773ea5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d68f83339e4b24d58033152f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "过红绿灯的时候，\n希望谁都不要到旁边来。\n…因为米浴来了就会变成红灯。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f061d48cfb67bf8d8a24ec620757bc4ae24d842bf01d034e48dec0c25664888f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e210312273d5c09a54da9930",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一个人洗澡的时候，\n会悄悄地练习唱歌。\n…因为会唱的比平时好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ec855f4b61596f45e4371ab52cbeb4a820fccefbb3dadcafa334cf711f93f55",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:adbe4638cf205a85259a4fb9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我喜欢舞台哦。\n闪闪发光的，看着舞台的大家\n都会露出笑容。",
      "source_fingerprint": "43855dfcf0dbf3c46f035295a56ab09e7bb71856207b3eab669f8b7c3a225fea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9636135a2e34eb891aedc8e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊呜…因为是好不容易穿上的衣服\n所以为了不低头走着，\n撞到膝盖了…",
      "source_fingerprint": "9cfda675c0fda4e2f86b774658ab28dda53c480912db517aed186a948ab93b23",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee257dbedc91e5bca5a3a8a9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "米浴也，能好好的绽放光彩吗。\n不…我相信米浴\n能成为那样的人的…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "50724031f3952b32ffd51c2c746991de93295b7ade7788cf6f79ff462ab38f88",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38ddeedf85184c6e8a1892a2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼…明明每天早上都有喝牛奶、\n为什么长不大呢。\n是因为…喝的量不够吗…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "dad309ade3a133449852e1cdd3b88e72213d1d905be519977dffed6e5835df95",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1f9b2a366df8d1c3af54d92",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "饭后的伸展运动，做吗？\n像猫咪一样喵地伸出去，\n后背会很舒服的哦…呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a4a9233047d6187c30d1a409c5ec94952a2614eb2191da8fb920efe4393a74b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5105908d83454e21a4333a32",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天晚上，一定要跟荒漠英雄…\n说出『那本书我也喜欢哦』\n今晚一定…告诉她…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b16a0691122b84b812a2e3e57eacf7146d2b11e36d61935f3b44eaeb44b2804",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91011"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
